WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:07.690
Previously on 
The Reflection

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.440
Where is Wraith?

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:13.950
I have no idea...

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.320
There's nothing to be gained from hurting him.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.520
You called me a "lighthouse," right?

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.270
But I'll only shine for Wraith.

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:31.760
You won't kill me.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.500
You can't kill me.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:38.350
I wanted to see the extent of your abilities.

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:39.890
What is it about me?

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:43.640
The ones we acquired in New Orleans...

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.640
They will be released.

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:51.100
In return, Eleanor, I would have you 
accept my master's invitation.

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:53.850
Who are you people?

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:56.360
Would you consider accepting her invitation?

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.160
To be a decoy?

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.610
Twenty years ago, an incident 
occurred at a certain facility,

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:05.330
and it burned up in a fire.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.380
They said there was one survivor.

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:12.230
Did you let your friends die?

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.470
That's exactly right.

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:03.780
Have you decided? There are others waiting...

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:06.530
W-Wait. We have to hurry and decide!

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.360
Will meat make you feel bloated?

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:10.200
Hell if I know!

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:10.800
Miss—

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:13.040
Oh, someone just decide already!

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.250
Maybe we could have both?

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:16.800
No, no.

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:19.570
We have to decide!

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:46.540
You know this is a trap. You could...

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:49.490
I know.

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:51.290
Even so, I...

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.420
Why are we physically tailing them?

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.920
The LA division's system should 
be able to track them.

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:43.170
I have a bad feeling about this. 
I want to see it with my own eyes.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:30.260
Eleanor and...

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:36.870
X-On.

00:05:38.470 --> 00:05:41.900
You both gave me a big opportunity.

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:45.280
I've gained wings and can fly freely now.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:48.280
So I'm grateful.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:01.430
Eleanor believes in you. Yeah, even now.

00:06:01.430 --> 00:06:03.170
Of course, I do, too.

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:08.550
That's why it's okay for you to 
believe in Eleanor... and us, too.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:36.370
Conman!

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.140
What's wrong?

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:01.460
Snakes... Snakes!

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.870
It's just an illusion.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:18.370
There were reports of someone 
with an ability like this!

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:45.610
They got through. How persistent.

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:47.150
Thru!

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:52.860
I'm ready.

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:16.760
Now we're dealing with magic tricks?

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:27.470
They're going through buildings and objects!

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:28.730
This isn't a magic trick!

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:30.710
Send me the footage.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:24.580
They're coming out!

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:36.590
Electricity!

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:04.270
Don't worry. I'll make certain that you die.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:33.070
Are you all right?

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:44.120
Why do you side with them?

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:46.290
I can tell...

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:49.120
You belong with us. You're one of us.

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:52.460
I guess talking won't get through to you.

00:10:57.710 --> 00:11:00.110
Then I'll have to burn you, here and now!

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:11.850
What a downer.

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:19.910
Vy!

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:35.540
I'm heading out.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:41.380
I'll find Eleanor on my own.

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:59.190
This motel is completely surrounded.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.440
That's X-On?

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.650
Someone that small?

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:28.600
Are we safe, with so many Reflected here?

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:31.930
Michael!

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:34.960
Lisa...

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:47.940
She was chasing after the car 
Eleanor was in, and they...

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:49.200
Where's Eleanor?!

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:24.320
I'm Clarence, head of the LA branch 
of the Anti-Reflected Squad.

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:37.640
About an hour ago, our surveillance 
satellite detected an anomaly.

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:43.360
So you know about all of the Reflected. 
I guess I'm not surprised...

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:47.220
I don't see anything weird here, though.

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:52.220
We don't know where the Reflected 
on Darkness's side went.

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:56.980
When the Reflection occurred,

00:13:57.380 --> 00:14:01.480
we called those enveloped by 
the smoke "Darkness Reflected,"

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:07.490
and those enveloped by the 
light "Brightstar Reflected."

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:11.990
These were the terms we came 
up with early in our research.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.470
So these Darkness Reflected...

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:18.590
In other words, the Reflected on Wraith's side...

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:25.710
It appears that someone on 
their side can shut out

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:27.470
our surveillance system.

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:31.260
That's nothing new.

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:37.270
This just means that we've been 
dancing to their tune all this time.

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.410
The Russian ninja?

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:59.330
What is this plan?

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:03.670
What is it?

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:17.730
If you're not going to finish me off, 
why bother with me?

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:28.170
This whole time, they've just shown us 
exactly what they wanted us to see.

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:34.410
That's why they didn't care that 
we were monitoring them.

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:38.330
Every time there was a fight, 
they were always the ones to fall back.

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:41.420
But this time was different.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:44.080
They were trying to kill me.

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:52.090
Now that they have Eleanor, 
they've changed their policy.

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:53.760
Eleanor?

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:08.920
About Eleanor...

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:12.610
That's exactly why we've brought you here.

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:18.560
Eleanor refused to work with us and contacted

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:21.120
those on Wraith's side by herself.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.090
Until we know what's going on,

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:27.880
we're going to keep you under our supervision.

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:30.880
You'll be staying here for a while.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:43.330
Pardon me.

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:51.150
Hey! She's just a kid!

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:53.400
She's no ordinary kid.

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:56.400
That's right. I don't want you 
to treat me like a kid.

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:57.660
Treat me as an equal.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.330
Lisa, no!

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:08.090
You have no right to lock me up here 
and take away my freedom!

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:27.690
Come on, now...

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:33.030
Don't shoot!

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:46.000
Vy!

00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:52.050
Michael!

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:01.060
Vy...

00:18:15.270 --> 00:18:16.860
Is that you, Vy?

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:32.360
They're calling me...

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.300
Who?

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:41.930
They...

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:51.400
I see...

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:03.240
Vy, don't! What's wrong?

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:04.740
These guys...

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:10.410
X-On, she's trying to go to Wraith.

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:11.500
Eleanor's there, too.

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:19.960
Lisa, let her go.

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:22.430
Let her go? But if I do that...

00:19:22.980 --> 00:19:25.630
She'll lead us to Eleanor.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:26.640
Huh?

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:29.640
Let her go. Let Vy go.

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:33.900
Got it.

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:44.330
Lisa, we're following Vy!

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:55.420
Stop! I won't let you have your way!

00:19:55.850 --> 00:19:58.420
Not monsters like you!

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:02.180
Monsters... That has a nice ring to it.

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:09.140
You monsters!

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:15.410
You fool!

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:54.020
<i>Ian, Reflected detected.</i>

00:20:54.660 --> 00:20:58.010
I haven't been able to detect 
any in a while. Finally...

00:20:58.010 --> 00:21:02.320
<i>There's an 84% possibility 
that it's a girl named Lisa.</i>

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:10.960
<i>Ian, where are you going?</i>

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:12.500
I'm going after them.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:17.130
Hey, that's a supercar.

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:19.020
So cool!

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:20.630
They're totally speeding.

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:23.260
Huh? Aw, I couldn't see...

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.120
What kind of car was it?

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:27.950
It was a futuristic black car.

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:29.980
I wanna ride in one!

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:31.600
You'd get caught immediately.

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:36.600
More importantly, we're finally 
in America, but...

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:38.100
Isn't it a bit dark?

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:41.940
Yeah. Aw, man...

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:43.590
Looks like it's going to rain.

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:50.140
You were hoping that something would happen

00:21:50.140 --> 00:21:52.500
when Eleanor encountered Wraith.

00:21:52.980 --> 00:21:55.910
You thought you'd be able to 
see what Wraith was up to.

00:21:56.760 --> 00:21:59.000
And even though it was a bit dangerous,

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.910
you thought it would be 
okay to offer up Eleanor.

00:22:01.910 --> 00:22:03.370
Isn't that right?

00:22:04.180 --> 00:22:08.930
It's not about what Wraith is up to. 
Eleanor herself is the problem.

00:22:57.290 --> 00:22:59.930
I thank you for coming all this way.

00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:06.780
I'm sure our master is very much 
looking forward to meeting you.

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:55.010
Next Time 
Eleanor

00:24:48.000 --> 00:24:55.010
Narration: Stan Lee
